What is NextJS?
A React Framework For building fullstack react framework
Handles route setuo and config. Handles requests and responses. Handles data fetching and submission

Key Features
Fullstack Apps
NextJS blends frontend+backend (in the same project)
Advantage: Frontend and backend tasks are part of the same project

File-Based routing
Routes are configured via the filesystem(folder+files)
Advantage: No code-based configuration or extra packages for routing required

Server Side Rendering
By defualt next renders all the pages on the server unlike react which has empty html when it receive from the server
Advantage: The finished HTML page(including content) is sent to the client (great for SEO)

